<item><title>French judge places Congo’s presidential aircraft in state custody</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/french-judge-places-congo-s-presidential-aircraft-in-state-87969a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/french-judge-places-congo-s-presidential-aircraft-in-state-87969a/</guid><category>Republic of Congo</category><description>The aircraft, seized in Bordeaux in 2020 during a €2.2 billion dispute with Commisimpex, is expected to be returned to the Republic of Congo.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:43:17 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cg.jpg" length="37606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Congo opens 20-hectare Madingo-Kayes farming zone</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-opens-20-hectare-madingo-kayes-farming-zone-14d176/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-opens-20-hectare-madingo-kayes-farming-zone-14d176/</guid><category>Republic of Congo</category><description>The site has solar-powered pumping for irrigation, mechanisation support and four Kavaki vehicles, with vegetables intended for markets in three cities.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:18:57 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-opens-20-hectare-madingo-kayes-farming-zone-14d176/share.jpg" length="42688" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-opens-20-hectare-madingo-kayes-farming-zone-14d176/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
